---
import Container from "../base/Container.astro";
import Icon from "../ui/Icon.astro";
---

<section
  class="py-24 bg-cream relative overflow-hidden"
  id="uptime-infrastructure"
>
  <!-- Dynamic glow circles -->
  <div
    class="absolute left-1/3 top-[-10%] w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full bg-brand-200/10 blur-[130px] pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>

  <Container>
    <div
      class="bg-surface-muted border border-brand-200/40 rounded-[32px] p-8 lg:p-16 relative overflow-hidden z-10 shadow-elevated"
    >
      <!-- Grid Background Pattern -->
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03] pointer-events-none bg-[radial-gradient(#303738_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:16px_16px]"
      >
      </div>

      <div
        class="relative grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center z-10"
      >
        <!-- Left Side: Editorial Introduction -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-6">
          <div
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand-300/40 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-xs"
          >
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-soft-gold"></span>
            <span
              class="text-[8px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-bold text-brand-850"
              >#1 Jasa Undangan Digital Indonesia</span
            >
          </div>

          <h2
            class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-brand-950 leading-tight"
          >
            Undangan Online yang <span class="italic font-normal text-soft-gold"
              >Cepat, Aman, dan Mudah Dibagikan.</span
            >
          </h2>

          <p
            class="text-text-secondary text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed font-sans font-medium"
          >
            Acaranya.id membantu Anda membuat undangan digital yang elegan,
            responsif, dan nyaman dibuka di berbagai perangkat. Dari informasi
            acara, RSVP online, galeri foto, hingga amplop digital, semuanya
            dirancang agar momen bahagia Anda tersampaikan dengan lancar kepada
            setiap tamu.
          </p>

          <!-- Verified Badges Group -->
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-2">
            <div
              class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 bg-white border border-brand-200/40 rounded-full text-[8.5px] text-text-secondary font-bold font-sans"
            >
              <Icon name="shield-check" size={10} class="text-success" />
              <span>Koneksi Aman dengan SSL</span>
            </div>
            <div
              class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 bg-white border border-brand-200/40 rounded-full text-[8.5px] text-text-secondary font-bold font-sans"
            >
              <Icon name="zap" size={10} class="text-[#B59A73]" />
              <span>Website Ringan & Responsif</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Side: 3 Infographic Modular Cards -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <!-- Panel 1 -->
          <div
            class="bg-white border border-brand-200/25 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xs space-y-4 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300"
          >
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cream text-cream flex items-center justify-center"
            >
              <Icon name="zap" size={18} class="text-soft-gold" />
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <h3
                class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-950"
              >
                Cepat Dibuka Tamu
              </h3>
              <p
                class="text-[10px] text-text-muted leading-relaxed font-semibold"
              >
                Undangan online dibuat ringan dan responsif agar mudah dibuka
                melalui link, baik dari WhatsApp, Instagram, maupun media sosial
                lainnya. Tamu dapat melihat detail acara tanpa proses yang
                rumit.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Panel 2 -->
          <div
            class="bg-white border border-brand-200/25 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xs space-y-4 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300"
          >
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cream text-cream flex items-center justify-center"
            >
              <Icon name="gem" size={18} class="text-soft-gold" />
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <h3
                class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-950"
              >
                Siap untuk Banyak Tamu
              </h3>
              <p
                class="text-[10px] text-text-muted leading-relaxed font-semibold"
              >
                Bagikan website undangan Anda ke keluarga, sahabat, dan rekan
                kerja dengan lebih praktis. Setiap halaman dirancang agar tetap
                nyaman diakses, bahkan saat dibuka oleh banyak tamu.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Panel 3 -->
          <div
            class="bg-white border border-brand-200/25 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xs space-y-4 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300"
          >
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cream text-cream flex items-center justify-center"
            >
              <Icon name="shield-check" size={18} class="text-soft-gold" />
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <h3
                class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-950"
              >
                Data Tamu Lebih Terjaga
              </h3>
              <p
                class="text-[10px] text-text-muted leading-relaxed font-semibold"
              >
                Fitur seperti RSVP online, buku tamu digital, dan amplop digital
                didukung koneksi aman untuk membantu menjaga privasi data acara
                dan kenyamanan tamu yang mengakses undangan Anda.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
